OL,3,AMushroom murderer trial undermined by
OL,4,A'catastrophic' hotel mix-up, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FLawyers for Australian mushroom
OL,7,Fmurderer Erin Patterson say her
OL,8,Fconviction was undermined by a
OL,9,F"catastrophic" mix-up that led to the
OL,10,Fjury staying at the same hotel as
OL,11,Fprosecutors and a key witness.
OL,13,FPatterson is serving a life sentence
OL,14,Fafter killing three of her relatives
OL,15,Fand trying to kill another by serving
OL,16,Fthem a beef Wellington containing death
OL,17,Fcap mushrooms at her Victoria home in
OL,18,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
