OL,3,AMushroom murderer trial undermined by
OL,4,A'catastrophic' hotel mix-up, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer lawyers also argued some evidence
OL,7,Fin the trial was too speculative, while
OL,8,Fevidence crucial to their own case was
OL,9,Fwrongfully excluded.
OL,11,FAt the same hearing, Victoria's
OL,12,FDirector of Public Prosecutions is
OL,13,Fappealing against the sentence, arguing
OL,14,Fa 33-year parole period is "manifestly
OL,15,Finadequate".
